// Per-repo debugger launch configurations.
//
// VS Code's "Run and Debug" sidebar reads this file. Each repo should
// keep only the configurations its language stack actually uses —
// listing every possible launcher here pollutes the picker UI.
//
// Common starters for ChannelAssist stacks are commented below.
{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "configurations": [
